Longest Common Prefex: 
For a given array, find the longest common prefex. 

Method:
Sort the array.
If first string & last string have common prefex then the entire array has the same prefix

Therefore, we compare the the first and last string in the while loop.

i<first.length() & i<last.length & the loop runs till prefix is same.

Thus we return the string from 0 to i.